    <string name="kill_off">System lockdown is off for this VPN</string>
    <string name="kill_message">Android controls this protection. In VPN settings, select Gozar, enable Always-on VPN and Block connections without VPN. Disconnecting or signing out may leave the device offline until Android lockdown is turned off. Gozar disables direct routing during lockdown and on Android 9 or earlier, where the state cannot be verified. LAN bypass covers TCP only. Per-app exclusions and root traffic have separate limitations. Status can be verified only while this service is running on Android 10 or later.</string>
