    <string name="ad_block_detail">Uses public AdGuard DNS over the VPN and sends DNS queries to AdGuard. It blocks many ad and tracker domains, not first-party or in-stream ads. Apps using their own encrypted DNS or direct IPs can bypass this filter.</string>
